--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IMPLEMENTATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data    : AnalyticsPageViewModel binds the shared S8 AnalyticsStore.fleetAnalytics(days) (web useFleetAnalytics)
          via asAnalyticsSource(); the raw verbatim-SI JsonElement is decoded to the typed FleetAnalytics model
          (AnalyticsPageModel.from) on the way through toFleetResource(), then projected onto UiState via
          BaseFeedViewModel.asUiState. No HTTP in the view. The range preset is the AnalyticsInteraction; a change
          re-keys the shared feed (combine -> flatMapLatest), the web RangePicker-driven refetch; switching tabs
          is pure local UI state and never re-fetches (web useState tab + useRangeState split).
Tabs    : Overview / Driving / Charging / Battery (web TabNav). Every web region reproduced in web order —
          hero gauges (6), Overview (Distance-by-Vehicle, Fleet Usage, Efficiency Leaderboard, Vehicle Comparison,
          Energy & Activity, Day-of-Week, Monthly Cost, Quick Links), Driving (6 perf cards, Speed/Trip/Duration
          distributions, Hourly, Temp-vs-Efficiency, Daily trend, Efficiency trend, 6 temperature stat cards),
          Charging (6 summary cards, Charger Types, Start Battery, Hourly, Charger Brands, Monthly trend, 4 Cost
          cards, Cost-by-Type), Battery (no-data empty | 5 cards + Health timeline + Capacity + Range +
          Degradation & Cycles). Each panel owns loading-free content + an honest EmptyState (web never blanks).
Charts  : A3 chart library exposes Bar/Line/Area/Combo + RadialGauge only (no pie/radar/scatter primitive on
          Vico 2.0). Faithful representations of the IDENTICAL data within the fixed component set, documented in
          each file header: web PieChart (Fleet Usage, Charger Types) -> categorical bar; web RadarChart (Vehicle
          Comparison) -> grouped bar over the same 0-100 normalised axes; web ScatterChart (Temp vs Efficiency) ->
          efficiency over ascending temperature line. Web dual-Y ComposedCharts -> single-axis ComboChart (Vico
          2.0 single value axis) keeping every series. Not a scope reduction — all series/panels preserved.
Units   : SI is converted ONLY at the AnalyticsPageFormat render boundary (S5) via the shared convertXFromSI
          factors — distance (km->display), speed (km/h floor m/s -> display), temperature (C->display), energy
          (Wh->kWh) — never stored/computed non-SI. fmtNumber/fmtInt via shared ChartFormat (locale grouping);
          currency = web useFormatting `${currencySymbol}${fmtNumber}` with the web '$' fallback (the settings
          document carries no currency field yet). Unit symbols (kWh/kg/kW/%) are verbatim tokens as in the web.
Strings : ALL analytics.* keys pre-existing in res/values/strings.xml (generated from the web i18n catalog:
          analytics.X.Y -> translation_analytics_X_Y). Added only the 5 web QUICK_LINKS labels
          (analytics.links.{statistics,compare,weeklyDigest,mileage,timeline}) absent from the catalog. Every
          visible literal resolves via stringResource (112 calls); error copy reuses translation_error_* keys.
Nav     : Destinations 'analytics' -> /analytics pre-existing (count unchanged); host wired via PageHosts.register
          in TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate (same step as the 6 prior A7 pages); deep link auto-registered by
          TeslaSyncNavHost. Quick Links render as labeled destination cards (the page-host seam exposes no nav
          controller and "other pages" are out of scope), so the section is reproduced without faking navigation.

